sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Pipeline as Ingestion Pipeline
    participant Chunker as Document Chunker
    participant Extractor as Metadata Extractor
    participant Embedder as Embedding Service
    participant Index as Vector Index

    Client->>Pipeline: Document intake
    activate Pipeline

    Pipeline->>Chunker: text splitting
    activate Chunker
    Chunker-->>Pipeline: raw chunks
    deactivate Chunker

    Pipeline->>Extractor: metadata enrichment
    activate Extractor
    Extractor-->>Pipeline: enriched chunks
    deactivate Extractor

    loop For each enriched chunk
        Pipeline->>Embedder: embedding generation
        activate Embedder
        Embedder-->>Pipeline: vector embeddings
        deactivate Embedder

        Pipeline->>Index: vector index insert
        activate Index
        Index-->>Pipeline: acknowledgment
        deactivate Index
    end

    Pipeline-->>Client: ingestion complete
    deactivate Pipeline
